\subsection{Sensitivity to the fuzzy shaping
weight $\lambda$}\label{sec:r3_1_lambda}

A reviewer might ask whether the numbers reported so far depend on a
cherry-picked value of the fuzzy shaping weight $\lambda$. To settle
this, we re-ran the full Strategy~B pipeline on CICIoT2023 with
$\lambda \in \{0.10, 0.25, 0.50\}$ and kept every other hyperparameter
fixed. Table~\ref{tab:lambda_ablation} reports the numerical results,
and Fig.~\ref{fig:lambda_sensitivity} visualises the sensitivity
curves.

